[I] Provides facilities for parsing and unparsing URIs

[T] network-uri is a Haskell library for parsing and unparsing URIs and for
[T] creating and resolving relative URI references, closely following RFC
[T] 3986. Its Network.URI module was split off from the network package in
[T] version 2.6.

[U] https://github.com/haskell/network-uri

